WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.774
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Which sound begins the

00:00:04.774 --> 00:00:05.384
word “ship”?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.576
The answer is: /sh/. Sh can represent the /sh/ sound.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:17.730
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which letters help spell

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.490
the /ch/ sound in chair?

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:23.396
The answer is: ch. Chair starts with ch.
